294
00:18:35,885 --> 00:18:37,011
I'll do my best to back you up.

295
00:18:37,262 --> 00:18:38,972
- Don't. Just stay put.
- Yes, sir. I'll stay put.

296
00:18:39,222 --> 00:18:41,891
Let's give it our all today

297
00:18:41,975 --> 00:18:44,227
and get the best managers
on our side.

298
00:18:47,772 --> 00:18:48,982
ANTACID

299
