You're having one too?

300
00:18:58,491 --> 00:18:59,659
Because we're a team.

301
00:19:49,209 --> 00:19:50,794
- Here they come.
- What?

302
00:19:52,837 --> 00:19:54,464
- Don't be nervous.
- Yes, sir.

303
00:19:55,507 --> 00:19:56,841
