Hello.

308
00:20:04,140 --> 00:20:06,059
- Have a seat right here.
- Hello.

309
00:20:06,559 --> 00:20:09,270
When is Hongsung going to hire
some new people?

310
00:20:09,354 --> 00:20:11,314
It's always the same faces.

311
00:20:11,397 --> 00:20:13,107
All old and worn-out.

312
00:20:13,191 --> 00:20:14,526
That's harsh, Ms. Cha.

313
00:20:14,609 --> 00:20:15,985
