314
00:20:16,069 --> 00:20:17,779
No, you're definitely not.

315
00:20:17,862 --> 00:20:19,697
I swear I am.

316
00:20:19,781 --> 00:20:21,157
No, I don't believe you.

317
00:20:21,241 --> 00:20:23,117
- Just pour us some drinks.
- Thank you.

318
00:20:23,201 --> 00:20:25,370
All right, give me your glasses.

319
00:20:48,893 --> 00:20:49,978
Delicious, isn't it?

320
00:20:58,152 --> 00:21:00,280
- Cheers!
- Cheers!

321
00:21:00,363 --> 00:21:02,866
- Cheers!
- Cheers!

322
